  "title": {
   "en": "Muteki Shounin no Isekai Nariagari Monogatari ~Gendai no Seihin o Jizai ni Toriyoseru Sukiru ga Aru Node Isekai de wa Rakushoudesu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "無敵商人の異世界成り上がり物語 ～現代の製品を自在に取り寄せるスキルがあるので異世界では楽勝です～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Story of the Invincible Merchant's Rise in Another World: Since I Have the Skill to Order Modern Products at Will, I Have an Easy Victory in Another World"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "An orphaned college student , Daichi Asakura, suddenly finds himself lost in another world—along with his beloved cat, Nike. Upon discovering his \"Trade\" skill, which allows him to import modern products, he uses both that and knowledge as his weapons. He's now aiming to make it big-time as a merchant—thus begins a fantasy isekai success story.",
   "ja": "愛猫のニケとともに異世界に迷い込んだ天涯孤独の大学生・朝倉大地。現代の製品を自由に取り寄せられる「トレード」スキルが発覚した彼は異世界で成り上がることを決意して――!? 現代の製品と知識を武器に商人として成り上がる――異世界サクセスファンタジー開幕!!"
  },
